  <title>EX-99.1</title>
 </head>
 <body style="padding:8px;margin:auto!important;z-index:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;position:relative;">
  <div style="z-index:2;min-height:0.5in;position:relative;"></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><p style="margin-left:13.333%;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Exhibit 99.1</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Allegro MicroSystems Reports Second Quarter 2027 Results</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Second Quarter Sales Increased by 29% Year-over-Year to $277 Million</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Record Industrial &amp; Other and Data Center Sales</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">GAAP EPS Quadrupled and Non-GAAP EPS Doubled Year-over-Year</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Manchester, NH, October 29, 2026 &#x2013;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Allegro MicroSystems, Inc. (&#x201c;Allegro&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Company&#x201d;) (Nasdaq: ALGM</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">), a global leader in power and sensing semiconductor solutions for motion control and energy efficient systems, today announced financial results for its second quarter ended September 25, 2026.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;We saw continued strong momentum in our fiscal second quarter, delivering our seventh consecutive quarter of sequential sales growth. Sales were $277 million, representing a 29% increase year-over-year. GAAP earnings per share quadrupled from $0.03 per share in the fiscal second quarter of 2026 to $0.12. Non-GAAP EPS grew to $0.26, doubling over the second quarter of fiscal 2026. Broad year-over-year sales growth in Automotive and Industrial end markets drove this strong performance, led by data center, which established a new record,&#x201d; said Mike Doogue, President and CEO of Allegro. &#x201c;Our forward demand signals strengthened significantly this quarter. We delivered our highest quarterly design-win performance since our 2020 IPO&#x2014;up nearly 40% year-over-year&#x2014;and bookings increased for the eighth consecutive quarter. With record design wins, a robust backlog, and expanding content across our target Automotive and Industrial markets, the leading indicators across our business give us high confidence in our path to exceed our target model of mid-teens annual sales growth.&#x201d;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;During the quarter, we also continued to execute on our strategic priorities of expanding profitability and generating strong cash flow,&#x201d; said Derek D&#x2019;Antilio, Executive Vice President and CFO of Allegro. &#x201c;On September 30, 2026, following the close of the second quarter, we made another $25 million voluntary debt repayment, underscoring the strength of our balance sheet and our confidence in Allegro&#x2019;s anticipated free cash flow generation.&#x201d;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Second Quarter Financial Highlights:</font></p>
